{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "404a602dfebf42245ba8bee05cc05566033edd07f092900e8ea9e8e0871bcaac", "ja": "（今日は貴音のPV撮影だ。けれど、開始早々、\n機材トラブルで中断してしまい……）", "zh": "（今天贵音要拍摄PV。\n不过，才刚开始就因设备故障而中断拍摄了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7cff8bc1ff9c586b67b822ef089dcacd9f51f59f99b8bf901b150ad60c018223", "ja": "あ、いたいた。待たせて悪いな、貴音。\nもうすぐ機材の復旧が終わるそうだ。", "zh": "啊，找到你了。贵音，抱歉让你久等了。\n设备似乎马上就会修复完毕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2f5e64a795b7f6c5f9e2994096239d316782891b99a402f280ba73313aa08045", "ja": "準備ができたらスタッフが呼びにきてくれるから、\nもう少しだけ待っていてくれ。", "zh": "一切就绪后，工作人员会来叫我们，\n你再稍微等一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "04979489e6dd3464e884446aeee6e3aa37707dc3c319cc6fc0b34355eb9b4b50", "ja": "かしこまりました。では、もうしばらく、\nこの場で月を眺めていることにいたしましょう。", "zh": "小女子明白了。\n那小女子再继续待在这赏月一阵子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "b2dd742ccfbdb1dc3cfcd0aeb54fd89943db027be659e7c237f727b7aa1cbe3b", "ja": "{$P$}も、いかがですか？　\n今宵はよい月が出ています。", "zh": "{$P$}不妨也一同赏月吧？\n今夜的月色十分美丽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "5e08214ec52a29b2925a7b23851033a03ef57d77fea792209b8245da66faabf9", "ja": "私がひとりじめするのも、気が引けますから。\nお時間があるのでしたら、ぜひ……。", "zh": "若让小女子独占这样的月色，就太过意不去了。\n若无要事，还请务必与小女子一同赏月……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2fe4f9321bc85339ecd82edb8bedcb05c7c36f2a9d62b83fc83302fc8af17636", "ja": "へえ、そんなに？\n時間が空いたし、そうさせてもらおうかな。", "zh": "哦，有这么美吗？\n反正时间空出来了，就让我一起赏月吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "03dea1f4e997dbccdc64d29c4472964d5980268634c7e63b11c9365d7da8c06c", "ja": "では、私の隣へ。\nこちらの方が綺麗に見えます。", "zh": "那么，请到小女子身边来。\n从这里看过去会更美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1009_p", "source_sha256": "589374046c6c5c401882f9bf215db56a785551bc5585d857451dec89c5701288", "ja": "それじゃあ、失礼して。\nおお……。たしかに綺麗だな。", "zh": "那我就打扰了。\n哦哦……确实很美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "e262d7d5d0f99872cc001aff9e1e9cf02a4d54926341f510ba7ffc01f682fc8c", "ja": "はい……。ふふっ、こうして穏やかに\n月を眺めるのは、いつ以来でしょう。", "zh": "是的……呵呵，上次像这样安稳地赏月，\n不知道是多久前的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "1c608ef263e5b5ffcf8c7f32204ad428b62cf1bb4696c9cba066ff8eded9525c", "ja": "四条の家にいる頃は、\n毎夜ひとりで月を眺めていたものですが……。", "zh": "小女子还待在四条家时，\n总是每晚独自赏月……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d25cb294c2c4c0034355621ed9b90f843dab11602d242a373d478d2b695d9aee", "ja": "最近は貴音も忙しかったからな。もう少し、\nスケジュールを調整できたら良かったんだけど……。", "zh": "因为贵音最近也很忙嘛。\n要是能稍微调整一下行程就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "c501d3d856b2b927e19183e5bd8cf90295df5147dc6ea6bd1d4874da978137ad", "ja": "いえ、どうかお気になさらないで下さい。\n私は今の活動に満足しています。", "zh": "没关系，请无须挂心。\n小女子对现在的工作心满意足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "9021bec2d7a4b053013138eaaf6b42861a712362f13c68e20ebeee9dc2ff6701", "ja": "それに、四条の家にいた頃は、今のように\n穏やかな気持ちで月を眺めてはいませんでした。", "zh": "而且，小女子还待在四条家时，\n赏月的心境并不如现在这般平稳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "e7d81f4f57dc35a52ee19e5fc8865c2b57f7db4236d594baf1c7911a295c67fb", "ja": "ただ、遠い故郷に思いを馳せて。\nそして、為すべき使命を心に刻むため……。", "zh": "那时只一心思念着遥远故土，\n并将小女子应尽的使命铭记在心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1016_p", "source_sha256": "34562c6a8af412f35a5e816a083594033026cb7fce6cd5fb4e1e5d5f9340f25a", "ja": "そうか……。\nでも、今は違うんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……\n但现在不一样了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "dcde9f01fb576c4c6ee4e8d0c716bd7e3d2a49f582bb5531f50b68c4a28dd468", "ja": "はい、今は……。こうして、共に月を眺めてくださる\n方のおかげで、変わったのだと思います。", "zh": "是的，现在不同了……多亏有人愿与小女子一同赏月，\n才能有所改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "33f27edd2cdcfc4a46f635a1ec9c16dcf036820befc4ad322a8290d457d1b103", "ja": "ですから……、あなた様。これからも私を、\nこうして、そばで見守ってくださいますか？", "zh": "所以……官人，\n你今后也愿意继续像这样陪伴在小女子身边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "d5580931fe714af2344f238e838b037b4da838b511b96e55abd6fe57f0dd72df", "ja": "アイドルとしても、四条貴音としても。\n私が正しく変わり続けるために……。", "zh": "让小女子不论是在偶像这方面，还是以四条贵音的身分，\n都能继续朝正确方向改变……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_1020", "source_sha256": "a33967b3fe4d92e08113bb6ad7b15b47c8ffb5fa8f47144c1b5e5c56e5d51720", "ja": "もちろん", "zh": "当然", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d2b20b0dab61d815e799e7dec6e5dd9b97726f50bb006b095fe6ed801fa3d59b", "ja": "もちろんだ。これからも全力で、\n貴音をプロデュースしていくよ！", "zh": "这是当然的。\n我今后也会尽全力培育贵音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_2001_008tak", "source_sha256": "edc826172fdf20c182339d2d91b3e0e5a25fc1d415c735deb0f79e8ca0ea24e3", "ja": "……ありがとうございます。\n真に頼もしきお言葉、安堵いたしました。", "zh": "……感激不尽。\n这着实可靠的回答，让小女子松了口气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_2002_008tak", "source_sha256": "31f47a71e48913576f026c84316545c13423a09b395e5393ca6725c125500a34", "ja": "では、今宵はもう少しだけ……。\nこうして、あなた様と共に……。", "zh": "那么，今晚请容小女子再稍微……\n与官人共处片刻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0094_2003_p", "source_sha256": "b9c65181dd0fd5ddab0fab2afb6f7b887f87e777e7a78249ac562caaa5c56eb6", "ja": "（貴音はこれからも変わっていく。だからこそ、\n俺は変わらず貴音の隣であり続けよう……）", "zh": "（贵音今后还会继续改变。\n正因为如此，我要永远不变地待在她身边……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
